{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And the clean one shall sprinkle upon the unclean.</b> Rabbi Akiva was precise in the Gemara of Yoma, from the fact that it is written על הטמא and does not say עליו — this comes to teach that if he sprinkled upon the unclean one, it is clean, but upon the clean one, it is unclean. And he said that concerning this Solomon, peace be upon him, said (Ecclesiastes 7:23): ״אמרתי אחכמה והיא רחוקה ממני״."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:34:00.085486868Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}